          "message": "feat(observe-core): per-field suppress predicates on Field (#9)\n\nFields render nothing for values a consumer declares degenerate —\nplaceholder identifiers, sentinel names, a zero that reads as \"no\nmeasurement\" — via Field(suppress=predicate). The predicate sees the\nresolved value before formatting, so applications can drop noise like\nframework-generated anonymous job names without a full custom\nformatter or a change to the canonical event."
